"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"English Choose language","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["English"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/en/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Sign in to sync"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/12"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Starting a business: how to protect your personal assets"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Only invest money you can afford to lose — never use family savings or borrowed funds"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Never sign personal guarantees for corporate loans; spouses should definitely avoid signing too"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Choosing the right legal entity before launching: sole proprietors and general partners are fully liable, while limited liability companies offer “limited” liability"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Improperly listed shareholders: never hold shares on someone else’s behalf"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Check the Ministry of Commerce records before signing; obtain written disclosures and include a “cooling-off period” in the contract"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Determine the business name, location, scope of operations, and registered capital before registration; with complete documents, you can obtain the business license on the spot"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Businesses requiring licenses must wait until they obtain one"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Figure out which category you fall into: producing or preparing food requires a permit, selling only pre-packaged goods needs a filing, while selling fresh meat and vegetables needs no permit at all"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Packaging food for sale makes it prepackaged food: labels must include production date, shelf life, and ingredient list without exception"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"General foods must not claim therapeutic effects: this applies to labels, instructions, ads, and live-stream scripts alike"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"The food industry faces criminal penalties: selling meat from diseased animals or products exceeding safety limits is already a crime; adding toxic or harmful non-food substances carries a minimum five-year sentence regardless of revenue"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Once you obtain a business license, you must file tax returns on schedule — even if you have no income, you still need to submit a return with all zeros"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Invoices must reflect actual transactions; small taxpayers can fully utilize tax exemptions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Scammers pretending to be tax officials demanding payments are fraudsters; tax filings must be done via the e-Tax Service or by calling 12366"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Writing “deposit” instead of “advance payment” in contracts, specifying penalty amounts, and treating credit terms as loans"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Sign a written contract within the first month of employment; register for social insurance within 30 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Wages must be paid according to contracts and laws; raises, loans, and bonuses all require written documentation"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Sell first, then produce: use pre-orders and small orders to confirm demand before investing in manufacturing"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Run the prototype through the production checklist before starting full production"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Keep copies of invoices and supplier documentation for every shipment; avoid purchasing goods priced significantly below market rates: if an employee buys counterfeit products, the employer can still be held legally responsible"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/12-21","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Whether creating designs yourself or purchasing licensed artwork, simply changing colors or adding icons does not count as “modifications” for copyright purposes"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Follow procedures at work; think carefully about who bears responsibility before offering unsolicited help"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Exit the process as planned when losses occur: opt for simplified deregistration when possible, or file for bankruptcy if debts exceed assets — don’t leave things unattended"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Before paying for third‑party store management, e‑commerce training, or “dropshipping” services, be sure to ask whether extra fees will be required and where the sales figures actually come from"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"Companies and individual businesses in China must report the previous year online from January 1 to June 30, even without business activity; annual reports are free"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/12"},"children":["Chapter 12"," ·"," ","Starting a business: how to protect your personal assets"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"12-21"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["21"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Whether creating designs yourself or purchasing licensed artwork, simply changing colors or adding icons does not count as “modifications” for copyright purposes"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Even if you alter an existing image by changing its colors, background, or adding your own icons, you still have not obtained permission to use that artwork. Making money by reproducing someone else’s artwork—whether you earn 30,000 yuan, reach 50,000 yuan in sales, or print 500 copies—constitutes copyright infringement and can lead to a prison sentence of up to three years. In trademark law, any mark that is “likely to cause confusion” is considered infringing as well."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Licensing fees from legitimate stock image libraries start…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Copyright law treats any unauthorized adaptation, translation, or annotation of a work as equivalent to outrig…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Whether creating designs yourself or purchasing licensed artwork, simply changing colors or adding icons does not count as “modifications” for copyright purposes"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Licensing fees from legitimate stock image libraries start at just a few dozen yuan per image. Hiring a designer to create original artwork can cost several hundred to several thousand yuan. For every image used on products, keep a record of the license and proof of purchase. The real challenge is avoiding the use of random images found online."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Copyright law treats any unauthorized adaptation, translation, or annotation of a work as equivalent to outright copying. Therefore, modifying an original image by changing colors, background, or adding icons still counts as using someone else’s work without permission. The legal thresholds for punishment are as follows: if you profit from selling artwork without permission from the copyright holder—earning at least 30,000 yuan in illegal gains, reaching 50,000 yuan in total illegal business volume, or producing 500 copies or more—you commit copyright infringement and may be sentenced to up to three years in prison and fined. If the illegal gains reach ten times that amount, the sentence rises to three to ten years. Selling counterfeit goods bearing unauthorized designs also carries penalties: selling for over 50,000 yuan or reaching 100,000 yuan in sales can result in up to five years in prison. For trademarks, using a mark similar enough to cause confusion on identical or related goods is also illegal. Even minor modifications do not create a safe zone; such changes remain infringing under current law (effective April 26, 2025)."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2020). 著作权法（2020 年修正，第五十二条第六项、第五十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c2/c30834/202011/t20201119_308796.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c2/c30834/202011/t20201119_308796.html"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2020). 刑法修正案（十一）（第二十、二十一项，即刑法第二百一十七、二百一十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/zdgz/202012/t20201227_503682.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/zdgz/202012/t20201227_503682.shtml"]},"；最高人民法院、最高人民检察院 (2025). 关于办理侵犯知识产权刑事案件适用法律若干问题的解释（法释〔2025〕5 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202504/t20250424_693977.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202504/t20250424_693977.shtml"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2019). 商标法（2019 年修正，第五十七条第二项；2026 年修订后为第七十二条第二项）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cnipa.gov.cn/art/2019/7/30/art_95_28179.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cnipa.gov.cn/art/2019/7/30/art_95_28179.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.npc.gov.cn/npc/c2/c30834/202011/t20201119_308796.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["There are three common pitfalls to watch for. First, printing cartoon characters or celebrity images found online onto clothing, mugs, or phone cases without permission. Second, commercial use of fonts: most require separate licensing, and free preview versions are not automatically free for business use. Third, including unauthorized assets in client designs—the seller remains legally responsible. To simplify compliance, use licensed stock image libraries and keep all license documents on file. Alternatively, require designers to specify the source and scope of any used materials in a contract, making them liable for any resulting issues. Beyond criminal penalties, civil damages and administrative fines apply as well: if public interests are harmed, illegal earnings may be confiscated and fines imposed at 1–5 times the illegal business volume. For trademark checks prior to production, see item 19 (verify samples against the full production list). Conversely, if someone uses your own designs without permission, these same legal provisions apply to protect your rights. Posting others’ comics or TV shows online with ads or memberships crosses a criminal line in Section 9, item 24 (fan-translated comics and reposting TV shows)."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/12-20"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Keep copies of invoices and supplier documentation for every shipment; avoid purchasing goods priced significantly below market rates: if an employee buys counterfeit products, the employer can still be held legally responsible"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/12-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"Follow procedures at work; think carefully about who bears responsibility before offering unsolicited help"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidd